.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_SIZE_PACKED 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_size_packed \- return the total packed size of archive files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__archive_size_packed("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        libmpq__off_t *" "packed_size"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__archive_size_packed\fP() to get the total packed size of all valid files in the archive.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function stores the total packed size in
\fIpacked_size\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__file_size_packed (3),
